<title>USA: Vermont names new head of tourism.</title>
<headline>Vermont names new head of tourism.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vermont has appointed a marketing expert from Michigan to head the State Department of Tourism.</p>
<p>Thomas Altemus will take over as the department's commissioner next month. He had served as head of Michigan's travel department since 1992.</p>
<p>Altemus replaces Bobbie Manes, who quit last year to start her own business.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
